   "npc": "3373",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I am an $r of medicine, $r. If you have come here to learn, I shall do my best to teach.",
   "time": 1791635064,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "3387|da8a5dad": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Jorn Skyseer",
   "npc": "3387",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Although we call this land the Barrens, to one who knows where to look this place teems with life.",
   "time": 1791639287,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3413|c879b3f9": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Sovik",
   "npc": "3413",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Hello, $N! If you don't see it in my shop, chances are good I can get it!",
   "time": 1791640963,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "3430|0e16a4d2": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mangletooth",
   "npc": "3430",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You! $R! Come here. <snort>\n\nTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>\n\nMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!\n\nThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth.",
   "time": 1791639364,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3432|c1a3099b": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mankrik",
   "npc": "3432",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I came to the Crossroads from the south seeking help, $c, but I find only cowards who turn their backs on me--even the mighty Thork insults me so. He is a good leader, but his dismissal of my plea causes me greater anger.\n\nHe claims my rage makes me hasty--that it clouds my judgement--but I will not rest until I have vengeance!",
   "time": 1791641466,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3433|ac5dfa0b": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tatternack Steelforge",
   "npc": "3433",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and $r cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.\n\nHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur.",
   "time": 1791639324,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3442|c0ad1190": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Sputtervalve",
   "npc": "3442",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Lots to do, lots to do! The Union's given us deadlines and they're not the sort you want to miss!",
   "time": 1791638170,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3448|dcea3712": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tonga Runetotem",
   "npc": "3448",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste.",
   "time": 1791635428,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3483|aa3c8600": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Jahan Hawkwing",
   "npc": "3483",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude.",
   "time": 1791638477,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3934|e013de07": {
